<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96193" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμόν</span></b> , τό,= <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111.2
				</span></i>
			, <i>weight,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12.301.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.1627.296
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτρα . . καὶ σταθμά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gorg.
					<u>Pal.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				746e
			</span></i>; and so in gen. and dat., <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				87.12
			</span></i> (Attic Law, <span class="entity">v B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφηῦρε . . σταθμῶν ἀριθμῶν καὶ μέτρων
					εὑρήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					432
				</span></i>
			, cf. Decr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.83
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.10.10
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτρα . . καὶ μέρη σταθμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					541
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1041
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				757b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				10.1
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>standard weight</i> kept under public authority, in pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1013.10
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὰ ξυληρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					975.2
				</span></i>
			 (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμός</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				804.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>.</div>
